  "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong>TreeBites Premium Flax Seeds</strong> are naturally nutritious seeds with a mild, nutty flavour and a satisfying crunch. They are an easy and versatile addition to everyday meals and can be enjoyed as part of a balanced diet.<span class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p>Flax seeds are naturally rich in <strong>dietary fibre, plant-based protein, omega-3 fatty acids and essential nutrients</strong>, making them a convenient ingredient for everyday nutrition.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Premium-quality flax seeds</li>\n<li>Naturally rich in dietary fibre</li>\n<li>Source of plant-based protein</li>\n<li>Contains omega-3 fatty acids</li>\n<li>Mild, nutty flavour</li>\n<li>Easy to add to everyday meals</li>\n<li>Suitable for smoothies, oatmeal, yogurt and salads</li>\n<li>Convenient everyday nutritional ingredient</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to Use:</strong><br>Add whole or ground flax seeds to smoothies, cereals, oatmeal, yogurt, salads and baked recipes. They can also be consumed as part of your preferred daily diet.</p>\n<p><strong>TreeBites — Nourishing Roots, Enriching Lives.</strong></p>",
